  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.12 Candidate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.12 “Candidate” means a student who has completed a training program and has been listed by the training program’s emergency medical services instructor coordinator as eligible to test at the final division approved practical or cognitive examination.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #13953, eff 4-30-24",
